  "definition": {
    "en": "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope.",
    "nb": "105 × 210 mm — halve A4-bredden i full høyde (A4 brettet én gang på langs, eller stående A5); tysk bransjeformat «Lang-DL», bredere enn DL og passer ikke i DL-konvolutt.",
    "de": "105 × 210 mm — halbe A4-Breite bei voller Höhe; das «Lang-DL» der deutschen Branche, breiter als DL und passt nicht mehr in den DL-Umschlag.",
    "es": "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope.",
    "ja": "105 × 210 mm — half of an A4 sheet's short side by its full height (A4 folded once lengthwise, or A5 standing); the German trade's «Lang-DL», wider than DL and no longer fitting a DL envelope.",
